        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Patina- PBR Maps\n\nTurn one image into a set of PBR maps with Patina: basecolor, normal, roughness, metalness and height, all derived from exactly what the picture contains. No regeneration and no tiling - feed a flat, evenly lit surface photo or an existing basecolor map, pick the maps you need and drop them straight into a 3D material. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_patina_pbr_maps.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
